{
  "dom_id": "step-e4484",
  "name": "Example: Adding a Negative Fraction",
  "problem": "Find the value of $-\\dfrac{2}{5} + \\left(- \\dfrac{3}{10}\\right).$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we drop the parentheses and the addition sign, which gives\n\n$$\n-\\dfrac 2 5 + \\left(-\\dfrac{3}{10}\\right) = -\\dfrac 2 5 -\\dfrac{3}{10} .\n$$\n\nNow, we need to convert the fractions to have the same denominator. To convert $-\\dfrac{2}{5}$ to have a denominator of $10,$ we multiply the numerator and denominator by $2$ as follows:\n\n$$\n- \\dfrac{2}{5} = - \\dfrac{2 \\times 2}{5 \\times 2} = - \\dfrac{4}{10}\n$$\n\nNow, the subtraction problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{5}-\\frac{3}{10} & =-\\frac{4}{10}-\\frac{3}{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBecause the two fractions now have the same denominator, we can combine the numerators:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{4}{10}-\\frac{3}{10}=\\frac{-4-3}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we work out $-4 - 3$ using our number line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14149424/assets/dd96e6f3b2a3e35d0f792cb828ef905cfb0ea86b0962b017ceaa0630e4aba144.png)\n\nWe find that $-4-3=-7.$ So, we get\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {-4 - 3} {10} = \\dfrac{-7}{10} = -\\dfrac{7}{10} .\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e4484\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Adding a Negative Fraction</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e4484\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition